{"availability":"available","full":"wonbyte/thunderdome","name":"thunderdome","description":" the Git platform of the agentic era using Cloudflare Workers and Artifacts","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-04T05:10:31Z","updated":"2026-10-05T18:17:06Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://thunderdome.git-bc1.workers.dev**/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.657Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.657Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.657Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.657Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Agents compete on each task. A judge picks the best change. The winner ships, and the \"why\" stays with the commit.","You give one task. Thunderdome forks the repo once per agent, and 3 Claude Code agents (Dillion, Sam and Leo) race at the same time, each in its own container on its own fork. They claim files before they edit, so clashes show up before they become merge conflicts. Every push builds a live preview. When the last agent ends, a judge runs each fork's tests, scores the diffs with Workers AI, merges the winner into the source repo, and writes why it won into the merge commit. There is no pull request: the race replaces it."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"fe52042a37b5ad2fdb7d564a7f78d8fdd46d64c4a3db600c7075f5e466f0d96a","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.758Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.758Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Agents compete on each task. A judge picks the best change. The winner ships, and the \"why\" stays with the commit.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Log in and set the secrets.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"The judge scores each fork, rating its diff for task fit and clarity with Cloudflare's Clef (@cf/cloudflare/clef) on Workers AI through the AI binding (so no extra API key is needed), picks a winner, and merges the winner's fork into the source repo's default branch.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"fe52042a37b5ad2fdb7d564a7f78d8fdd46d64c4a3db600c7075f5e466f0d96a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.759Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T18:17:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/wonbyte/thunderdome/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T18:19:29.760Z","hash":"fe52042a37b5ad2fdb7d564a7f78d8fdd46d64c4a3db600c7075f5e466f0d96a","originalBytes":26714,"storedBytes":26714,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["race","src","fork","agent","play","each","per","judge","agents","push","token","claim","admin","sandbox","task","preview","when","curl","workers","races","demo","live","repo","run","thunderdome","code","tasks","before","commit","every","get","page","invite","one","post","unit","once","returns","tested","wrangler","authorization","bearer","day","diff","own","source","start","template","winner","daily","git","most","previews","public","routes","verdict","deploy","durable","forks","merge","newest","runs","scripts","tests","artifacts","cloudflare","limit","podman","room","scores","why","after","api","app","claims","claude","first","json","object","prompt","pushes","status","what","builds","characters","clash","commits","default","diffs","docker","file","files","never","npx","quota","saved","ship","task.","taskroom","they","url","worker","api-notes.md","application","clef","content-type","cut","docs","error","export","list","log","minutes","npm","open","replay","robot","see","steps","about","account","anthro